  "kind": "statement",
  "title": "The constructible cocone is a filtered 2-colimit",
  "statement": "Let $\\ell$ be a prime and $X$ a scheme whose underlying topological space is Noetherian. The\nconstructible cocone $E\\mapsto D_{\\mathrm{cons}}(X,E)\\to D_{\\mathrm{cons}}(X,\\Qlb)$\n([def-sfb-constructible-cocone]) is a filtered 2-colimit in the sense of\n[sk-def-sfb-filtered-two-colimit].",
